    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.poster.avif?t=1742875018\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.webm?t=1742875018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/44adca872eee5e39cf24852466046b4a.mp4?t=1742875018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u2018Nimillion\u2019 is a <strong>fun yet challenging physics-based, rocket ship simulation adventure located in a \u2018Metroidvania\u2019 style open world</strong>. Fly your ship by controlling only its thrusters. Acquire new ship abilities: a grabbing rope, short boost, shield and more. Fine-tune your ship\u2019s hardware to adjust thruster forces, fuel consumption and more. With the help of upgrades and tuning of your rocket ship, you must rely on your skills to <strong>explore your surroundings navigating through difficult terrain, environmental phenomenons, physics puzzles and platforming challenges while avoiding hostile entities</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACQUIRE NEW ABILITIES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.poster.avif?t=1742875018\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.webm?t=1742875018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889880/extras/cae0bc528a867e57fc260a5a7a5a67bd.mp4?t=1742875018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rope tool, booster, 0 